    "preamble": "Unknown vs Present on 7 April, 2012 In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present: The Honourable Mr. Justice A.K.Jayasankaran Nambiar Friday, The 6Th Day Of April 2018 / 16Th Chaithra, 1940 WP(C).No. 6027 of 2018 Petitioner(S) 1 James M.J. @ Chacko Aged 66 Years, S/O. Chacko, Moongamackal House, Kakkayanchal, Cherupuzha P.O, Kannur District 2 Chinnamma James Aged 64 Years,W/O.James, Moongamackal House, Kakkayanchal, Cherupuzha P.O, Kannur District By Advs.Sri.S.Sreekumar (Sr.) Sri.C.P.Peethambaran Respondent(S): 1. Cherupuzha Grama Panchayath Represented By The Secretary, Cherupuzha P.O 670 511 Kannur District 2. The Secrtary Cherupuzha Grama Panchayath, Cheerupuzha P.O 670 511 Kannur District 3. Thomas K.V S/O. Varghese, Kozhichal, Pulingome Village, Kannur District 670 511 4 . Sr. Vineetha D/O. K.V Varghese, Sisteer Superior Of Adoration Convent, Kozhichal, Pulingome Village, Kannur District 670 511 R3,R4 By Adv. Sri.Grashious Kuriakose (Sr.) Unknown vs Present on 7 April, 2012 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/132260182/ 1 R3,R4 By Adv. Sri.M.M.Anto R3,R4 By Adv. Sri.George Mathews R1,R2 By Adv. Sri.Sunil Nair Palakkat R1,R2 By Adv. Sri.K.N.Abhilash By Senior Counsel Sri.S.Sreekumar",
    "facts": "TRUE COPY OF THE NOTICE DATED 12-01-2018 ISSUED BY STATE BANK OF INDIA, KANNUR TO THE 1ST PETITIONER WP(C).No. 6027 of 2018 (C) EXHIBIT P-31(A) TRUE COPY OF THE NOTICE DATED 12-1-2018 ISSUED BY STATE BANK OF INDIA, KANNUR TO THE 1ST PETITIONER EXHIBIT P31(B) TRUE COPY OF THE NOTICE DATED 12-1-2018 ISSUED BY STATE BANK OF INDIA, KANNUR TO THE 1ST PETITIONER EXHIBIT P31(C) TRUE COPY OF THE NOTICE DATED 22/12/2017 ISSUED BY STATE BANK OF INDIA, KANNUR TO THE 1ST PETITIONER EXHIBIT P31(D) TRUE COPY OF THE NOTICE DATED 22/12/2017 ISSUED BY STATE BANK OF INDIA, KANNUR TO THE 1ST PETITIONER EXHIBIT P31(E) TRUE COPY OF THE NOTICE DATED 12/1/2018 ISSUED BY STATE BANK OF INDIA, KANNUR TO THE 2ND PETITIONER EXHIBIT P31(F) TRUE COPY OF THE NOTICE DATED 12/1/2018 ISSUED BY STATE BANK OF INDIA, KANNUR TO THE 2ND PETITIONER EXHIBIT P31(G) TRUE COPY OF THE NOTICE DATED 22/12/2017 ISSUED Unknown vs Present on 7 April, 2012 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/132260182/ 4 BY STATE BANK OF INDIA, KANNUR TO THE 2ND PETITIONER EXHIBIT P31(H) TRUE COPY OF THE NOTICE DATED 22/12/2017 ISSUED BY STATE BANK OF INDIA, KANNUR TO THE 2ND PETITIONER EXHIBIT P32 TRUE COPY OF THE ORDER DATED 22/1/2018 OF THE 2ND RESPONDENT EXHIBIT P33 TRUE COPY OF THE NOTICE DATED 22/1/2018 OF THE PRESIDENT OF THE PANCHAYATH EXHIBIT P34 TRUE COPY OF THE DRAFT MINUTES OF THE MEETING DATED 25/1/2018 OF THE PANCHAYATH COMMITTEE EXHIBIT P35 TRUE COPY OF THE PAPER REPORT PUBLISHED IN MADHYAMAM DAILY DATED 26/1/2018 EXHIBIT P36 TRUE COPY OF THE PAPER REPORT PUBLISHED IN MALAYALA MANORAMA DAILY DATED 30/1/2018 EXHIBIT P37 TRUE COPY OF THE PAPER REPORT PUBLISHED IN DEEPIKA DATED 2/2/2018 EXHIBIT P38 TRUE COPY OF THE APPLICATION DATED 14/2/2018 TRUE COPY OF THE BUILDING TAX RECEIPT DATED 26.02.2018 ISSUED BY THE 2ND RESPONDENT OF THE 1ST PETITIONER WP(C).No. 6027 of 2018 (C) EXHIBIT P40(A) TRUE COPY OF THE BUILDING TAX RECEIPT DATED 26.02.2018 ISSUED BY THE 2ND RESPONDENT OF THE 2ND PETITIONER EXHIBIT P41 TRUE COPY OF THE PERMISSION DATED 16/11/2015 OF THE PCB WITH RESPECT TO GOODLEY ENTERPRISES EXHIBIT-R3(B). TRUE COPY OF THE PERMISSION DATED 16/11/2015 OF THE PCB WITH RESPECT TO GRACE ENTERPRISES EXHIBIT-R3(C). TRUE COPY OF THE LICENSE APPLICATION WITH RESPECT TO GOODLEY ENTERPRISES DATED 17/12/2014. The petitioners have approached this Court aggrieved by Ext.P32 order of the Secretary of the respondent Panchayat, which has been affirmed in Ext.P34 minutes of the meeting of the respondent Panchayat, that endorses the views of the Secretary. The facts in the writ petition would indicate that, against an order passed against the petitioners refusing to renew their Dangerous and Offensive (D & O) licence for units engaged in the manufacture of packaged drinking water and soda, the petitioners had approached this Court through W.P(C).No.16914 of 2017.",
